  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 restores extraction of Cn/Kx literals and [KhamsinClasses] members from Razor @code/@functions blocks by parsing the block text directly; code-behind extraction remains semantic. 0.4.0: Tailwind CSS v4 compatibility: v4 layer prelude and cascade order, property-based utility ordering, hover media wrappers, structural arbitrary variants, max-*/min-* breakpoint semantics, and a corrected Preflight in the base layer. Adds semantic [KhamsinClasses] extraction for closed class lists in C# and Razor code-behind, replacing the removed lexical C# scanners; dynamic values report KHM008. Custom CSS keeps its authored layers instead of being forced into base. Breaking: CSharpSourceScanner and Find*Literals APIs are removed.",
